  "details": "Version build 1248 & 1249\nIf a Quest/Quest 2 user switches to Desktop/PC, it will show to other players as them still being on Quest, and PC only world portals will have the X that shows when quest users look at a PC only portal, and if the user goes to the portal or uses portal prompt, it will still let them use the portal. Even after crossing into a PC only world, the platform of the user still shows as Quest to other people. \nSo far I have been able to recreate this by either opening up VRChat on steam desktop after playing Quest 2 VRChat right away, or by opening up VRChat on desktop while still having VRChat open on my quest 2. \nI have recreated the opposite once, where on Quest it showed me as being on PC when I opened up VRChat on my Quest after closing VRChat on desktop.\nI constantly switch between the two platforms to test my cross-platform avatars, so this happens to me a lot.\nScreenshots shown: Shows me as Quest while on Desktop\nSwitching to a PC Only Avatar to show I'm on Desktop.",
